**Self-Audit:**
[ ] No credential in client file (`OPENAI_API_KEY` is in `app/api/chat/route.ts`).
[ ] Third-party call runs server-side.
[ ] `.gitignore` covers `.env`.
[ ] Identity derived from session (implicit in this simple example, but `req` is used).
[ ] RLS not applicable to this component.
[ ] SQL not used.
[ ] XSS: `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` used, sanitized with `DOMPurify`.
[ ] Logging: Structured error logging in API route.
[ ] Dependencies: Verified versions (OpenAI SDK 4.x, DOMPurify 3.x, JSDOM 24.x).
[ ] Negative tests: Handled `!response.ok` and `!reader`.
